# env: MNML_PROFILE=dev
# There is one mnml: a build from source and an installed one share a
# data root and paint the same statusline. A leftover MNML_PROFILE from
# an older run.sh names nothing — no ` dev ` chip beside the mode
# (`src/config/data_root.zig`; the data-root side is a unit test there).
write hello.txt "hi"
open hello.txt
expect screen contains "hello.txt"
expect screen lacks " dev "
